    "body": "Fixes black Recording previews caused by a tiny gap at the end of composition instructions. The exact universal Release archive passed the complete playback journey and nine rendered-color checks on an Intel macOS15 VM: play/pause, continuous take boundary, seeks, Selected Clip reset, end/replay and normal Quit/reopen. Both arm64/x86_64 Release slices and fresh ZIP/signature checks passed. The separate playback qualification records this later native result; the build manifest describes packaging-time checks. Requires macOS15+. Ad-hoc developer preview, without Developer ID/notarization. ARM runtime, physical devices, real camera/audio timing, migration, human accessibility and trusted downloaded-app launch remain unverified. No cloud account or paid service is required.\n\nPlayback evidence: https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/framelet/actions/runs/43298428068"
